#
# Generic
#

ModuleDoliTMDName      = DoliTMD
ModuleDoliTMDDesc      = TMD requests: a mail received on the TMD mailbox creates a ticket, followed until it is invoiced
DoliTMDDescription     = TMD requests: a mail received on the TMD mailbox creates a ticket, followed until it is invoiced
DoliTMDDescriptionLong = Each mail received on the TMD mailbox (module Inbox) creates a ticket assigned to the chosen person, linked to the thirdparty or the contact of the sender, and a TMD request followed until it is invoiced.
DoliTMD                = DoliTMD

#
# Setup
#

ModuleSettings                = Settings
TmdSetupReception             = Reception of the TMD requests
TmdSetupMailbox               = Mailbox of the TMD requests
TmdSetupMailboxHelp           = Each mail received in the inbox of this mailbox (module Inbox) creates a ticket and a TMD request. The messages written from these tickets give this mailbox as reply-to address: the answers of the customers come back to it and are added to the ticket.
TmdSetupNoMailbox             = None
TmdSetupAssignUser            = Assign the tickets to
TmdSetupAssignUserHelp        = One or several people: each new ticket is assigned to them (the first one of the list in « Assigned to », all of them as support users, tab Contacts of the ticket).
TmdSetupNotifyEmail           = Notify the creation of the tickets to
TmdSetupNotifyEmailHelp       = The mail « New ticket created » of the tickets of DoliTMD goes to this address (several separated by commas) instead of the one of the module Ticket, which stays the one of the other tickets (now: %s). Empty: the one of the module Ticket.
TmdSetupNotifyEmailNone       = none
TmdSetupMailFrom              = Sender address of the mails
TmdSetupMailFromHelp          = Every mail of DoliTMD, the ones of the module Ticket for the tickets of the requests included (by default, these keep the address of the module Ticket). A mailbox of Inbox sends by its server; the other addresses, and always the module Ticket, by the mail server of Dolibarr. The answers of the customers come back to the mailbox of the TMD requests.
TmdSetupMailFromDefault       = Mailbox of the TMD requests
TmdSetupMailFromByInbox       = %s — mailbox of Inbox
TmdSetupMailFromByDolibarr    = %s — mail server of Dolibarr
TmdSetupInboxDisabled         = The module Inbox must be enabled to receive the TMD requests by mail.
TmdSetupNoInboxMailbox        = No mailbox in the module Inbox: add it from Inbox > Settings > Mailboxes.
TmdSetupMailboxNotActive      = This mailbox is not active in Inbox: no mail is read there.
TmdSetupSaved                 = Setup saved

